            "a11f6efA242-logsofquotients-P09a-h2"
        ],
        "title": "Write the input as a power of $$10$$",
        "text": "$$\\log_{10}(10)=\\log_{10}(10**1)$$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
        "license": ""
    },
    {
